sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor You
    participant CLI as ouroboros wrap-file
    participant Parser as The language's own parser
    participant File as Your source file
    participant Run as Your program, run as usual
    participant Helper as The helper file
    participant Sink as debug.info

    You->>CLI: wrap-file shop.py
    CLI->>Parser: where does each function begin and end?
    Parser-->>CLI: byte offsets of bodies and of every exit
    CLI->>File: splice the recording in, change nothing else
    CLI->>Helper: drop the helper next to the file
    CLI-->>You: {"ok": true, "functions_wrapped": 4}

    You->>Run: python3 shop.py tea mug kettle
    loop once per wrapped call
        Run->>Helper: entered f, arguments snapshotted
        Helper->>Sink: {"p":"in", "fn":"f", "a":"52.0", ...}
        Run->>Helper: returned 5.0 after 0.000001 s
        Helper->>Sink: {"p":"out", "fn":"f", "r":"5.0", "d":1e-06}
    end
    Run-->>You: Total: 51.80

    You->>Sink: ouroboros trace debug.info
    Sink-->>You: 4 calls: what each was given, what each returned
